From: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
Subject: [PATCH] arm: dts: mt7988: add secure-monitor RNG node

Backport the MT7988 RNG node from Frank's U-Boot tree.

Origin: https://github.com/frank-w/u-boot/commit/7d67d3784dfdf828fec76b3b2b5ce4a9ec59a5f2
Signed-off-by: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>

--- a/arch/arm/dts/mt7988.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm/dts/mt7988.dtsi
@@ -66,6 +66,10 @@
 	hwver: hwver {
 		compatible = "mediatek,hwver", "syscon";
 		reg = <0 0x8000000 0 0x1000>;
+	};
+
+	rng {
+		compatible = "mediatek,mt7988-rng";
 	};
 
 	timer {
